noPhotos

# anti-B0 -> D'_1+ e- anti-nu_e (LLSW), D'_1+ -> D*0 pi+ pi0 (PHSP)
# Non-resonant D(*)pipi l nu through a broad D** as in Belle II 119670000x.dec

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  D'_1+  e-  anti-nu_e   LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D'_1+
1.0  D*0 pi+ pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D'_1-

End
